window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Bound by Blood and Shadow</b> is a pulse-pounding fantasy adventure where ancient magic, betrayal, and destiny collide. When oaths are tested and kingdoms tremble, two souls must decide if their bond is strong enough to withstand the storm. Packed with <b>dark secrets, forbidden power, epic battles, and heart-stopping twists</b>, this novel will grip fans of <b>dark fantasy, sword and sorcery, and enemies-to-allies tales</b> from the very first page.</p><p>Step into a world of <b>magic, danger, and sacrifice</b>—but beware. Every choice comes with a price.</p>"; 
